{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"549ed8bcbad7e5116de46bb00f09d479790dee5740fd0fcdc2d917bcb034e633","ja":"見知らぬ場所","zh":"陌生的地方","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"00697faabce279c99529e5d56a4eee770f062d9fea00e5d0ba90877324f6289b","ja":"楽しいな～♪　記憶を取り戻す前は、\nこんな風に一緒に遊んでたりしてたのかな？","zh":"真开心啊～♪　在找回记忆之前，\n我们也像这样一起玩耍过吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bcec8d04c5500bae131fca5eebac36f93c54f2ca9892d413a39ad05ab5c40502","ja":"かもね。けど、いつまでも平和じゃいられなかったん\nじゃないかな。機動風紀委員とかも、いる世界だしさ。","zh":"也许吧。不过，总觉得也不可能一直和平下去呢。\n毕竟在这个世界里，连机动风纪委员之类的都有嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e88f7573e2543bb9245e203f8262344d8c752238b5dab844d8bdd4d424d03d51","ja":"アタシとこのみさんは、一緒に遊べなかったよね。\nむしろ見つけたら、みんなすぐに逃げなきゃっ！","zh":"我和木实小姐都没能一起玩呢。\n倒不如说一看到她，大家就必须立刻逃跑才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e703df87ef2381868406f514e736223a9c8ee817ac31da7ea1b3c0685ab64898","ja":"あははっ、たしかに！　逃げろ逃げろ～！\n捕まったらやばいぞ～！","zh":"啊哈哈，确实！快逃快逃～！\n被抓住可就惨啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a02965dd787d9dab4c1a599add9193e76ad908a7557e3de4bc7ec0f852fadd63","ja":"はぁはぁ……つい本気で走っちゃったわ。\nスタッフさんたち、大変だったかも……。","zh":"哈啊、哈啊……不知不觉就认真跑起来了呢。\n工作人员们可能吃苦头了吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"8ee4daff7e8a68f9b89eb257046c6db8cc3398286a07aec8a3acab5e9c4bae88","ja":"そうですね、ごめんなさい……あれ！？","zh":"确实呢，对不起……咦！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2d26366f224778ce1887d1da8c4e74fa3bf15d5887361aeff5fde555cbe5d4cc","ja":"スタッフさんたち、誰もいないです～っ！？","zh":"工作人员们，一个人都不在吗～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"665f3c480638debbd06abe1da5992e04e2135bbd4640207a04dec147ec016ed0","ja":"はぐれたのかな？　なら、連絡して……ん！？\nどうなってんだ、つながらないぞ……？","zh":"走散了吗？既然这样，联系一下……嗯！？\n怎么回事，打不通啊……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"afcea624c5d394ddec52d5271ec768b47114ce632ebeb3a2f7329e837f460522","ja":"じゃあ、●●●●プロデューサーに……\nえ、こっちもダメ！？　なんで～っ！？","zh":"那、去找●●●●制作人……\n哎，这边也不行！？为什么啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"01dcaa9cb02c054d163a90a641fa2c9cb9910bf13da86d129400af67713cfbff","ja":"と、とにかくさっきの場所に戻ろう……って、あれ！？\n地図アプリも動かなくなってる！？","zh":"总、总之先回刚才的地方吧……咦，等等！？\n地图APP也动不了了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"9540339b70553f7960dd8793b2e72397fc7df398b31ff5cb3d50bd82096dd4ad","ja":"誰もいないし、電波も繋がらない……。\n……私たち……今、どこにいるの……？","zh":"一个人也没有，信号也连不上……\n……我们……现在到底是在哪里啊……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"ea1c4f88f2550c0f0b67bcbca794b50352f1609ff3cb27596cc659a618946ca2","ja":"はわっ！？　い、今、なんか黒いのが……！","zh":"哇呀！？刚、刚才好像有什么黑黑的……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"58a636f09e5224c077dafd260ac4eeeff4bdbec58f5594378cbb64bbb3e94ab3","ja":"えっ！？　……なんだ、カラスか。\nこのあたり、独特な雰囲気があって不気味だな……。","zh":"诶！？……什么嘛，是乌鸦啊。\n这附近有种独特的气氛，怪渗人的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"1e00d57619aa9210ceb818a92dff4f30503b2d7657707f6520df15d49681945c","ja":"ええ、本当に『忘れられた街』に来たみたいな……\nいえ！　こういうときは、楽しいことを考えましょ！","zh":"嗯，真的就像来到了“被遗忘的街道”一样……\n不对！这种时候，还是去想些开心的事情吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[55].text","source_sha256":"a46a67b56d0153153a2185f90f056996403eee282c7bb7572b45374cf1ecf059","ja":"そ、そうだよねっ！　ええと……じゃあ、撮影が\n終わったら、みんなで美味しい物を食べに行こうよ！","zh":"也、也是呢！那个……那等拍摄\n结束后，大家一起去吃好吃的吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[56].text","source_sha256":"a000c8dd9e000adb959bfc18a1af645f977015a59db4150a2a4593ccc9a33a33","ja":"う、うん！　6人でいろいろシェアするのも、\n楽しそうだよねっ。","zh":"嗯、嗯！　6个人一起分享各种东西，\n好像也挺开心的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"faa5ec860f83a9162f1366a8c657ab7919e3660c230a5350a3010749b88311e1","ja":"じゃ、じゃあ何を食べたいか話しながら進も……あ！\nここ、さっき通ったとこじゃない！？","zh":"那、那咱们一边聊想吃什么一边往前……啊！\n这里，刚才不是走过吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1745.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"9cb99399d74f9ab0c28f8e34fa62a109b465d9bbb7a2d3ea971bd181f4b16219","ja":"ほ、本当だ！\nじゃ、じゃあ、次は今度はこっちの道に……。","zh":"真、真的是这样！\n那、那么，接下来就走这条路……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
